on jump:
    set {_b} to block below player
    if {_b} is any wool:
        set {_color} to type of {_b}
        loop blocks above player:
            if loop-block is {_color}:
                teleport player to block above loop-block
                play sound "entity.enderman.teleport" with volume 0.8 and pitch 1.6 at player
                stop loop

on sneak toggle:
    player is not sneaking
    set {_b} to block below player
    if {_b} is any wool:
        set {_color} to type of {_b}
        loop blocks below block below player:
            if loop-block is {_color}:
                teleport player to block above loop-block
                play sound "entity.enderman.teleport" with volume 0.8 and pitch 1.2 at player
                stop loop
